      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The authors have developed a method for the prevention of angina pectoris \"'secondary exacerbation' developing during He-Ne laser irradiation of the Zakharyin-Head skin sites. Intake of aevit (a multivitamin preparation) in a daily dose of 600 mg allows increasing the length of exposure to He-Ne laser in the most grave coronary cases and prolongs the remission. A rationale for He-Ne laser therapy efficacy combined with aevit is given."},
